title: "WBC ΔΣ (tessera): a keyboard-driven manual differential counter"
abstract: >-
  A keyboard-driven manual differential white blood cell counting tool for
  haematology laboratory personnel, built under a public Design History File
  (IEC 62304 Class A): requirements, hazards, tests and traceability are part
  of the repository.
